title: Labor Affairs
subtitle: The industrial Ruhr region is aflame with labor unrest
on-arrival: labor_affairs_timer = 6; labor_affairs_seen_ai = 1; dvp_affairs_timer = 1; 
view-if: labor_minister_party == "DVP" and labor_affairs_timer = 0 and strike_term_seen = 0 and dvp_action_timer == 0
new-page: true
face-image: img/Kollwitz_Weavers.jpg
tags: event

= Labor Affairs


The employers have started a major lockout to force the workers to take more cuts to wages and benefits. There is a need for the Labor Ministry to arbitrate in conflicts between employers and workers.

- @dvp_balance
- @dvp_support_employers

@dvp_balance
title: The DVP will try to strike a compromise between the sides.
subtitle: Both sides need to share the pain in the current crisis.
view-if: labor_minister_party == "DVP" and dvp_ideology == "Left" and (dvp_leader == "Stresemann" or dvp_leader == "Thiel" or dvp_leader == "zu Dohna-Schlodien" or dvp_leader == "Glatzel")
on-arrival: dvp_liberal_strength += 3; dvp_liberal_dissent -= 3; dvp_labor_dissent += 1; dvp_industrialist_dissent += 3; z_left_dissent += 2 if z_in_government; z_labor_dissent += 1 if z_in_government; z_center_strength += 1 if z_in_government; z_center_dissent -= 1 if z_in_government; ddp_labor_dissent += 2 if ddp_in_government; ddp_liberal_dissent -= 1 if ddp_in_government; ddp_liberal_strength += 1 if ddp_in_government; ddp_bourgeois_dissent += 1 if ddp_in_government; ddp_business_dissent += 1 if ddp_in_government; dnvp_christian_social_strength += 3 if dnvp_in_government; dnvp_christian_social_dissent -= 3 if dnvp_in_government; dnvp_authoritarian_dissent += 3 if dnvp_in_government; labor_dissent += 2 if spd_in_government; strike_term_seen += 1; ddp_cohesion += 1; ddp_left += 1;

@dvp_support_employers
title: The DVP will support the employers in their demands.
view-if: labor_minister_party == "DVP" and dvp_ideology != "Left" or (dvp_leader != "Stresemann" and dvp_leader != "Thiel" and dvp_leader != "zu Dohna-Schlodien" and dvp_leader != "Glatzel")
on-arrival: labor_dissent += 4 if (in_grand_coalition or spd_toleration); workers_dvp -= 1; coalition_dissent -= 1 if coalition_dissent > 0 and spd_in_government; workers_kpd += 1 if spd_in_government or spd_toleration; workers_spd += 1 if not spd_in_government and not spd_toleration; capital_strike_progress -= 1 if capital_strike_progress > 1; capital_strike_progress -= 1 if capital_strike_progress > 8; pro_labor -= 1; strike_term_seen += 1; dvp_left += 1; ddp_right += 1; ddp_cohesion -= 0.5; lvp_left += 1;
